---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
---

<Shell
  title="Grid Map — TavaOne Solar"
  description="Maidenhead grid square map with propagation overlay for amateur radio operators."
>
  <section class="page-hero" aria-label="Grid map">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Propagation <span class="dim">· Grid Map</span></p>
      <h1>Maidenhead <span class="em">Grid Map</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">Interactive grid square map with real-time propagation overlay — see where signals are reaching right now.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="signal" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 80" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <g class="wave-grp" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.65">
          <path d="M -200,40 C -167,12 -133,12 -100,40 C -67,68 -33,68 0,40 C 33,12 67,12 100,40 C 133,68 167,68 200,40 C 233,12 267,12 300,40 C 333,68 367,68 400,40 C 433,12 467,12 500,40 C 533,68 567,68 600,40 C 633,12 667,12 700,40 C 733,68 767,68 800,40 C 833,12 867,12 900,40 C 933,68 967,68 1000,40 C 1033,12 1067,12 1100,40 C 1133,68 1167,68 1200,40 C 1233,12 1267,12 1300,40 C 1333,68 1367,68 1400,40 C 1433,12 1467,12 1500,40 C 1533,68 1567,68 1600,40 C 1633,12 1667,12 1700,40 C 1733,68 1767,68 1800,40 C 1833,12 1867,12 1900,40 C 1933,68 1967,68 2000,40 C 2033,12 2067,12 2100,40 C 2133,68 2167,68 2200,40"/>
        </g>
      </svg>
      <span class="tag">GRID</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="map-placeholder" aria-label="Map coming soon">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="seclabel">Phase 3</p>
      <h2>Grid map coming soon</h2>
      <p class="sec-intro">The interactive Maidenhead grid square map with propagation overlay is planned for Phase 3. It will show real-time spot data from PSKReporter and RBN overlaid on the grid, colored by signal strength and band.</p>

      <div class="grid cols3" style="margin-top:40px">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="ico">🗺️</div>
          <h3>Maidenhead Grid</h3>
          <p>Find your grid square, look up DX grid squares, and calculate beam headings and distance from your location.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="ico">📡</div>
          <h3>Live Spot Overlay</h3>
          <p>PSKReporter and RBN spots displayed on the map — see which grid squares are receiving your signal right now.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="ico">📊</div>
          <h3>Band Filter</h3>
          <p>Filter spots by band (10–160 m) and mode (FT8, CW, SSB) to focus on what matters for your current operating.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/">← Back to dashboard</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/learn/">Learn about propagation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Shell>
